VALUES('company','走进金亚','走进金亚','走进金亚','ABOUT JINYA','ABOUT JINYA','郑州金亚包装有限公司是一家集设计、印刷、制作于一体的一站式包装生产厂家，深耕包装领域，专注不干胶标签、包装袋无版印刷和彩盒定制。

公司配备多台高精度印刷、复合、模切、分切及制袋设备，以严谨高效的生产管理和完善服务体系，为每一款包装的品质与交付保驾护航。','/assets/jinya/img/walkin-home-bg.jpg','/assets/jinya/img/walkin-home-bg.jpg','探索更多','/page/about',1,1,'{"media_items":[{"title":"各类不干胶卷筒标签","image":"/assets/jinya/img/sample-1.jpg","video_url":"","url":""},{"title":"特材卷标","image":"/assets/jinya/img/sample-2.jpg","video_url":"","url":""},{"title":"无版卷材 无版包装袋","image":"/assets/jinya/img/sample-3.jpg","video_url":"","url":""},{"title":"八边封包装袋","image":"/assets/jinya/img/sample-4.jpg","video_url":"","url":""}],"metrics":[{"title":"","value":"10000","unit":"m²","text":"印刷生产基地","icon":"","prefix":""},{"title":"","value":"100","unit":"万+","text":"产能标签/袋/盒","icon":"","prefix":""},{"title":"","value":"20","unit":"条","text":"自动化生产线","icon":"","prefix":""},{"title":"","value":"24","unit":"小时","text":"快速响应24小时内出货","icon":"","prefix":""},{"title":"","value":"6","unit":"小时","text":"快速出稿","icon":"","prefix":""}]}','html-baseline:home:company',0,500,'normal',@html_now,@html_now)
